# Own CI control-plane files.
#
# Ruleset Enforcement:
# To enforce these code owners, configure a GitHub Branch Ruleset:
# Settings -> Rules -> Rulesets -> New ruleset -> Target branches (default/pattern)
# -> Require a pull request before merging -> Require review from Code Owners.
#
# - .github/CODEOWNERS
# - .github/dependabot.yml
# - .github/workflows/**
# - .github/actions/**
/.github/CODEOWNERS @duranserkan
/.github/dependabot.yml @duranserkan
/.github/workflows/** @duranserkan
/.github/actions/** @duranserkan

# Dependency declarations and resolution data are a supply-chain control plane.
# Branch rulesets must require code-owner review for these patterns.
*.csproj @duranserkan
*.fsproj @duranserkan
*.vbproj @duranserkan
*.proj @duranserkan
*.props @duranserkan
*.targets @duranserkan
*.rsp @duranserkan
*.slnx @duranserkan
packages.lock.json @duranserkan
packages.config @duranserkan
package.json @duranserkan
package-lock.json @duranserkan
.npmrc @duranserkan
NuGet.Config @duranserkan
/global.json @duranserkan
